    "m_Title": "Translate the vertex to be relative to the new origin",
    "m_Content": "This subtraction make s the vertex use the special origin point of the shard instead of the actual origin (which is at 0,0,0). \n\nThis let's us rotate the point as though it were at at the shard origin",
